  "series": "Hidden JS #1",
  "title": "Stop writing formatLakhs() by hand.",
  "sub": "Plus fetch timeouts and errors that keep their cause.",
  "intro": "Hidden JS #1: 3 built-ins that delete code you wrote.",
  "tricks": [
    {
      "eyebrow": "Indian number format",
      "title": "12,34,567 is built in",
      "note": "Add <b>currency: 'INR'</b> for ₹12,34,567.00",
      "before": {
        "label": "7 lines, integers only",
        "code": [
          "function formatLakhs(n) {",
          "  const s = String(n);",
          "  const last3 = s.slice(-3);",
          "  const rest = s.slice(0, -3)",
          "    .replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{2})+$)/g, ',');",
          "  return rest ? rest + ',' + last3 : last3;",
          "}"
        ],
        "lang": "js"
      },
      "after": {
        "label": "1 line, decimals too",
        "code": [
          "new Intl.NumberFormat(",
          "  'en-IN').format(n)"
        ],
        "lang": "js"
      }
    },
    {
      "eyebrow": "Fetch timeouts",
      "title": "Fetch timeout in 1 line",
      "note": "Throws a <b>TimeoutError</b> you can catch. Node 18+ and modern browsers.",
      "before": {
        "label": "controller + timer + cleanup",
        "code": [
          "const c = new AbortController();",
          "const t = setTimeout(() => c.abort(), 5000);",
          "await fetch(url, { signal: c.signal })",
          "  .finally(() => clearTimeout(t));"
        ],
        "lang": "js"
      },
      "after": {
        "label": "nothing to clean up",
        "code": [
          "await fetch(url, { signal:",
          "  AbortSignal.timeout(5000) })"
        ],
        "lang": "js"
      }
    },
    {
      "eyebrow": "Debugging",
      "title": "Errors that keep their cause",
      "note": "Node prints the full <b>[cause]</b> chain in the stack trace.",
      "before": {
        "label": "custom field nobody knows about",
        "code": [
          "catch (err) {",
          "  const e = new Error('Failed');",
          "  e.original = err; throw e;",
          "}"
        ],
        "lang": "js"
      },
      "after": {
        "label": "standard since ES2022",
        "code": [
          "throw new Error('Failed',",
          "  { cause: err });"
        ],
        "lang": "js"
      }
    }
  ],
  "caption": "Stop writing formatLakhs() by hand.\n\nHidden JS #1: 3 built-ins that delete code you wrote.\n\n1. Intl.NumberFormat('en-IN') → 12,34,567 and ₹ formatting\n2. AbortSignal.timeout(5000) → fetch timeouts, no cleanup\n3. new Error(msg, { cause }) → keep the original error\n\nWhich one goes in your next PR? Comment 1, 2 or 3.\n\nSend this to the teammate who wrote formatLakhs().\nSave this for later.",
